# Glint Weaver ({5}{G}{G}, reach): "distribute three +1/+1 counters among one, two, or three target creatures" - any creatures, either
# side's (CR 601.2d). Bot1 puts two on Bot2's Grizzly Bears (a 4/4) and one on its own (a 3/3): a noncreature (Mox Ruby) is refused as a
# target, and shares that do not add to three (one and one) are refused. "Then you gain life equal to the greatest toughness among
# creatures you control": Bot1's own greatest is 3 (the Glint Weaver and the Bears), not the opponent's 4, so Bot1 gains 3 (20 to 23).

